<%- include('../partials/head') %><%- include('../partials/nav') %><main>
<section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> A WORLD OF PEOPLE. A SIMPLE HELLO.</span><h1>Good conversations<br>go a <em>long way.</em></h1><p>Practice a language with someone who speaks it.<br>Help someone with yours. Grow together, one hello at a time.</p><div class="row hero-actions"><a href="/register" class="btn dark">Find your voice <%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'arrow'}) %></a><a href="/helpers" class="btn outline">Explore helpers</a></div><div class="hero-foot"><span class="mini-orbs"><i>Olá</i><i>Hi</i><i>Salut</i></span><p>Real people. Shared stories.<br><strong>Always a little more connected.</strong></p></div></div>
<div class="hero-art"><div class="art-top"><span class="tag">THE BEST WAY TO LEARN? TOGETHER.</span><span>↗</span></div><div class="speech speech-one">Hello.<span>Start anywhere.</span></div><div class="speech speech-two">Olá!<span>Go somewhere new.</span></div><div class="art-bottom"><span class="sun-symbol">✳</span><p>You bring your curiosity.<br>We’ll help you find your people.</p><span>01 / ∞</span></div></div></section>
<section class="language-strip wrap"><span>ONE COMMUNITY.<br>MANY WAYS TO SAY HELLO.</span><% for(const l of ['English','Portuguese','French','Spanish','Japanese']){ %><a href="/helpers?language=<%= l %>"><%= l %> <span>↗</span></a><% } %></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">PEOPLE, NOT PERFECT GRAMMAR</span><h2>Find someone on your wavelength.</h2></div><a href="/helpers" class="text-link">Meet all helpers <%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'arrow'}) %></a></div><div class="helper-grid"><% for(const h of helpers){ %><%- include('../partials/helper-card',{person:h.user,offers:h.offers}) %><% } %><% if(!helpers.length){ %><div class="empty"><h3>Your community starts here.</h3><p>Create a profile and share the first practice offer.</p><a class="btn dark" href="/register">Join the community</a></div><% } %></div></section>
<section class="how-section"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">SMALL STEPS. REAL CONNECTIONS.</span><h2>A good conversation is closer than you think.</h2><div class="steps"><article><span>01</span><h3>Find your person.</h3><p>Choose a language, a level, and a friendly face. Or let Match Me find an available helper.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Make time to talk.</h3><p>Both say yes. Meet in a private room for 15 minutes of easy, everyday practice.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Pass it forward.</h3><p>Share a language you know. Your Help Given and Help Received tallies celebrate each connection.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="wrap trust"><div><span class="eyebrow">A SPACE TO BE YOURSELF</span><h2>A little less pressure.<br>A lot more possibility.</h2></div><div><h3>Your pace. Your boundaries.</h3><p>Private, one-to-one rooms for adults 18+. Leave whenever you need to, block unwanted contact, and report concerns. No public session recordings.</p><p class="muted">This university prototype includes private text chat and live audio/video. Reports are stored for project review; this is not a staffed moderation service.</p></div></section><section class="cta wrap"><h2>Your next chapter<br>starts with <em>hello.</em></h2><a class="btn light" href="/register">Let’s get talking <%- include('../partials/icon',{name:'arrow'}) %></a></section>
</main><%- include('../partials/end') %>
